-- Phase 186 — a request must be able to end: adds the reconciliation sweep's soft-delete + streak
-- columns to request_intent (see RequestIntent.sq for the full column docs; this migration must stay
-- byte-for-byte in sync with that file's CREATE TABLE statement, per the SQLDelight-migration rule).
